    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1725503956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Our dog simulator is a real dog paradise where you can absolutely get away with it:<br><br>- Run around the city and bark at everyone;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/1862e0017a3104ac784a19569b49928d.poster.avif?t=1725503956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/1862e0017a3104ac784a19569b49928d.webm?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/1862e0017a3104ac784a19569b49928d.mp4?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Piss and mark your territory in the city enough, let these bastards know who it really belongs to;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/95ebc3b47459e9c0d297ea2cc081ae08.poster.avif?t=1725503956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/95ebc3b47459e9c0d297ea2cc081ae08.webm?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/95ebc3b47459e9c0d297ea2cc081ae08.mp4?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Fly through the sky shooting passersby;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/4da7c99e1c270975801a32848fb26bc4.poster.avif?t=1725503956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/4da7c99e1c270975801a32848fb26bc4.webm?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/4da7c99e1c270975801a32848fb26bc4.mp4?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Throwing fireballs;<br><br>- To ride a boat;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/0911d2f81f3f73b660f49151197e2573.poster.avif?t=1725503956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/0911d2f81f3f73b660f49151197e2573.webm?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/0911d2f81f3f73b660f49151197e2573.mp4?t=1725503956\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>- Shoot lasers from the eyes;<br><br>... and most importantly, spoil everything! And for this you get destroyer bonuses, and not as usual\u2026<br><br>The city must be destroyed. Unleash the destructive hurricane inside! Blow it all to hell!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/6739746aa30c2bb3ea949c8756dc78d4.poster.avif?t=1725503956\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2211940/extras/6739746aa30c2bb3ea9